				xp: 10
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "&5秘术&r"
			x: 1.0d
			y: -3.0d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "振幅与稀有度"
			description: [
				"&5Arcana&r 是一种附魔强度的等级。随着 &5Arcana&r 的提升，&a更稀有的附魔会变得更常见，而常见的附魔则会变得更稀有&r。这一过程会持续到附魔的稀有度完全颠倒为止。 &o这是否有利（因为许多常见附魔仍有其用途）则由附魔者自行决定&r。"
				""
				"However, another effect of &5arcana&r is that when it gets past certain thresholds the minimum number of enchants you can get at once will increase. &aAt 25% you gain 1 extra enchantment, while at 75% you will always gain 2 extra enchantments&r."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["57A973761D22E204"]
			id: "630330E69D6E2677"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1D45081B63329C6C"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "我现在理解奥术了。"
				icon: "apotheosis:heart_seashelf"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "240D96FDAD5AA53F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "附魔师的谜题"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "octagon"
			subtitle: "烛光下的方块数独附魔"
			description: [
				"如果你真的想专注于为你的收藏寻找特定的附魔组合，&o反复尝试会令人沮丧&r，浪费宝贵的经验。有时你就是找不到自己需要或想要的东西。"
				""
				"进入&6矩阵附魔台&r。这张略有不同的附魔台，&a只需将普通附魔台转换而成&r，其运作方式与未经强化却威力十足的同类附魔台截然不同。"
				""
				"The Matrix table instead &aconverts small amounts of lapis and experience levels incrementally to generate colored \"puzzle pieces\", which can then be laid into the item to create a finished enchantment sequence&r. &oThis table only uses the default styles of bookshelves&r, &ahowever it can be focused by a layer of colored candles&r to GREATLY influence what you want to produce. More on the candles afterwards."
				""
				"&a使用加号按钮可以为物品生成组件&r；这会消耗一定量的经验值和部分投入的紫水晶。 &a创建后，左键点击可从侧边栏选取组件，右键点击可旋转组件&r。 &a将匹配的组件合并，右键点击将其与棋盘上已有的组件合并以提高其等级&r。尝试将所有组件组合在一起时，务必选择最有利的形状。 &o通过矩阵表，你可以为物品获得2-4个附魔，前提是位置摆放得当。&r"
				""
				"&6A recommended start is to surround your matrix table with one layer of bookshelves, but then use candles for the second layer&r. &aUp to 12 candles can be used to focus the enchantments, with each candle increasing the chance of certain types of enchantments appearing by 200%&r, &lthis maximizes at a whopping 2400% weight chance increase at maximum color focus&r. &oThis isn't to say it isn't still possible to draw something else that was not influenced, but chances are vastly skewed in your favor, and you can always try again after finalizing it.&r "
				"&o每次操作前，蜡烛可以更换以帮助你生成其他想要的部件；部件出现概率所受影响的数量也会显示在生成的部件上。&r"
				""
				"&a已抽中的附魔将有额外的400%概率出现，使收集多个附魔以合成更高等级变得更加容易&r。 &4使用矩阵表时，只能进行默认的附魔界限操作&r，仅靠此表无法将附魔提升至超越其基础数值的apotheosis附魔等级。"
				"&o如果一开始附魔效果不佳，不妨先完成附魔再重试，以控制成本&r。 &a按需少量使用经验值存储也是一种非常有利且强大的策略&r，能让你尽情尝试或创造附魔。"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: false
			min_width: 500
			id: "42EBC6A3EED2A061"
			tasks: [{
				id: "55A7594CB7511001"
				type: "item"
				item: "quark:matrix_enchanter"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "4024593E1C894456"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
		}
